    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): the clocks and the command queue in the crate (spec 39 step 9c)\n\nSimulationClock and SkirmishClock move to native/rust/src/clock.rs, with\nbindings of the same names that keep GDScript's fields as properties. The\nlane's clock tells tick_advanced on the object emit_on gave (SimEvents),\nlent while the handlers run. CommandQueue moves to native/rust/src/queue.rs,\nheld by LaneState: its tick commits the filled commands, each told as\ncommand_committed, then runs the lane's tick, as main.gd's handler did.\nThe GDScript classes and their gdUnit tests are gone; their scenarios run\nin cargo, and tests/sim/test_clocks.gd and test_lane_queue.gd hold what only\nGodot sees. Where each went was settled with the user and is recorded in\nthe spec.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5ZVr4nFd2tmHJXh2r",
